[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u3053\u6700\u8FD1\u8ABF\u67FB\u306B\u51FA\u3066\u3070\u304B\u308A\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3057\u3001\n\u3000\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u3086\u3063\u304F\u308A\u4F11\u3080\u3068\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002\n\u3000\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u76E3\u8996\u306E\u4F9D\u983C\u3082\u306A\u3044\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3060\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I\u0027ve been doing a lot of investigations lately.\nI think I\u0027ll take it easy today.\nDoesn\u0027t look like I need to watch Walther either.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u2026\u2026\u3068\u3001\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306E\u3060\u304C\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...or so I thought)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3080\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u306A\u305C\u304B\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u304C\u3044\u3066\u3001\u4FFA\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\n\u3000\u305A\u3063\u3068\u898B\u3066\u304F\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(For some reason, Walther is here,\nstaring at me constantly)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3064\u3044\u3066\u304F\u308B\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why are you following me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3044\u3002\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3064\u3044\u3066\u304F\u308B\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey. Why are you following me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u305C\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026\u79C1\u306F\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u76E3\u8996\u5BFE\u8C61\n\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u8996\u754C\u306B\u5165\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u306F\n\u5F53\u7136\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why, you ask... Since I am under your surveillance,\nit\u0027s only natural that I remain within your sight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u81EA\u899A\u306F\u5927\u5909\u7D20\u6674\u3089\u3057\u3044\u304C\u3001\n\u305D\u308C\u3058\u3083\u3042\u4FFA\u304C\u52D5\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3068\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u3082\n\u52D5\u3051\u306A\u3044\u3060\u308D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While I appreciate that self-awareness,\nthat means you can\u0027t move unless I do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\u3001\u79FB\u52D5\u3059\u308B\u969B\u306F\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u8A31\u53EF\u3092\u3068\u308B\u3064\u3082\u308A\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. That\u0027s why I was planning to ask\nfor your permission before moving anywhere."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3068\u3066\u3082\u9762\u5012\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3046\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This is going to be troublesome...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are you doing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3060\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are you doing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306F\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u76E3\u8996\u5BFE\u8C61\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u305D\u308C\u3089\u3057\u304F\u632F\u821E\u3063\u3066\u307F\u3088\u3046\u3068\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3057\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Since I am under your surveillance,\nI thought I should act accordingly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306F\u89B3\u5BDF\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3070\u304B\u308A\u3067\u3001\n\u3055\u308C\u308B\u5074\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u306A\u304B\u306A\u304B\u65B0\u9BAE\u306A\u4F53\u9A13\u3067\u3068\u3066\u3082\u9762\u767D\u3044\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m always the one observing others,\nso being the subject of observation is quite new.\nIt\u0027s a fascinating experience!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u521D\u3081\u3066\u306E\u4F53\u9A13\u3067\u3042\u308C\u3070\u3001\n\u3000\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3082\u304B\u3093\u3067\u3082\u9762\u767D\u3044\u3068\u8A00\u3044\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u3001\n\u3000\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u306F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(He\u0027s the type to find anything interesting\nif it\u0027s his first time experiencing it...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u8FD1\u3059\u304E\u306A\u3044\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re a bit too close"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u304B\u5206\u304B\u3089\u306A\u3044\u304C\u3001\n\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u8FD1\u3059\u304E\u3084\u3057\u306A\u3044\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don\u0027t know what you\u0027re doing,\nbut aren\u0027t you a bit too close?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u306F\u3001\u5931\u793C\u3044\u305F\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\n\u3067\u3059\u304C\u9060\u616E\u306A\u3055\u3089\u305A\u3002\u3069\u3046\u305E\u3001\n\u9685\u304B\u3089\u9685\u307E\u3067\u3001\u79C1\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u76E3\u8996\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3051\u308C\u3070",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, my apologies.\nBut please, don\u0027t hold back. Feel free to\nmonitor my every move."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u76E3\u8996\u3067\u3042\u3063\u3066\u89B3\u5BDF\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3002\n\u3053\u3093\u306A\u306B\u8FD1\u3044\u5FC5\u8981\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3060\u308D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is surveillance, not observation.\nYou don\u0027t need to be this close..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E00\u6319\u624B\u4E00\u6295\u8DB3\u3092\u898B\u3066\u304A\u304F\u5FC5\u8981\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306E\u3067\u306F\n\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\u3000\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3042\u308C\u3070\u3001\n\u898B\u9003\u3055\u306A\u3044\u3088\u3046\u8FD1\u3044\u307B\u3046\u304C\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don\u0027t you need to watch my every movement?\nIn that case, wouldn\u0027t it be better to stay close\nso you don\u0027t miss anything?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u4FE1\u3058\u3089\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3060\u304C\u3001\n\u3000\u3053\u308C\u306F\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u306A\u308A\u306E\u6C17\u9063\u3044\u2026\u306A\u306E\u304B\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I can\u0027t believe it, but is this\nWalther\u0027s way of being considerate...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4FFA\u306F\u4ECA\u65E5\u3001\u4F11\u307F\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3002\n\u3060\u304B\u3089\u304A\u524D\u3082\u4FFA\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u306F\u306A\u3044\u305E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m off duty today.\nSo you don\u0027t need to stick with me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u5225\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u304C\u5C11\u3057\u96E2\u308C\u305F\u6240\u304B\u3089\n\u304A\u524D\u3092\u76E3\u8996\u3059\u308B\u3089\u3057\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Another knight will be watching you\nfrom a distance today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3002\u305D\u308C\u306F\u5931\u793C\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\n\u79C1\u306E\u3053\u3068\u306F\u6C17\u306B\u305B\u305A\u3001\u5B58\u5206\u306B\u304A\u4F11\u307F\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that so? My apologies then.\nPlease enjoy your day off without concern for me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3075\u3046\u2026\u2026\u5F15\u304D\u4E0B\u304C\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u52A9\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u3000\u8CB4\u91CD\u306A\u4F11\u65E5\u304C\u306A\u304F\u306A\u308B\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3060\u3063\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Phew... glad he backed off.\nI almost lost my precious day off.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3055\u3066\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3058\u3083\u3042\u4F55\u3092\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002\n\u3000\u305F\u307E\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u672C\u3092\u8AAD\u3080\u306E\u3082\u3044\u3044\u306A\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Now then, what should I do?\nReading those books I\u0027ve been meaning to get to might be nice.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3048\u3070\u3001\u30A8\u30B9\u30AB\u306F\u3069\u3053\u306B\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3060\uFF1F\n\u3000\u6687\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u306A\u3089\u3001\n\u3000\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u308B\u306E\u3082\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Come to think of it, where\u0027s Escha?\nIf she\u0027s free, maybe we could go somewhere\ntogether...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3064\u3044\u3066\u304F\u308B\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why are you following me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3064\u3044\u3066\u304F\u308B\u3093\u3060\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why are you still following me?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u77E5\u308A\u305F\u3044\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u7570\u90A6\u4EBA\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u304C\u3069\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u4F11\u65E5\u3092\n\u904E\u3054\u3059\u306E\u304B\u3092\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to know!\nHow does a foreign alchemist\nspend their day off!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3001\u666E\u6BB5\u76E3\u8996\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\n\u5BFE\u3059\u308B\u5F53\u3066\u3064\u3051\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Is this payback for me\nwatching you all the time?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\uFF1F\u3000\u4F55\u3092\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\uFF1F\n\u79C1\u306F\u305F\u3060\u305F\u3060\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u8208\u5473\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...? What are you talking about?\nI\u0027m simply fascinated by you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are you doing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u4F55\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3060\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...What are you doing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u3092\u89B3\u5BDF\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u7570\u90A6\u4EBA\u306E\u79C1\u751F\u6D3B\u3001\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u8208\u5473\u6DF1\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m observing Sir Logy.\nA foreigner\u0027s private life is most intriguing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u3044\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you really think this is okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u89B3\u5BDF\u3057\u3066\u306F\u3044\u3051\u306A\u3044\u3068\u306F\n\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u3066\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304B\u3089\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, no one said I couldn\u0027t observe..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u8A6D\u5F01\u3060\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That\u0027s sophistry!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u5C0F\u9063\u3044\u3084\u308B\u304B\u3089\u3001\u3069\u3053\u304B\u884C\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Here\u0027s some money, go somewhere else"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u5C0F\u9063\u3044\u3092\u3084\u308B\u3002\n\u3053\u308C\u3067\u3069\u3053\u304B\u3078\u884C\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Here\u0027s some spending money.\nGo somewhere else."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u306F\u3001\u30AF\u30EA\u30BB\u30EB\u30C0\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3092\n\u3057\u307E\u3059\u306D\u3002\u5F7C\u5973\u3068\u540C\u3058\u304F\u3001\u91D1\u92AD\u306B\u3042\u307E\u308A\n\u9813\u7740\u304C\u306A\u3044\u79C1\u3092\u6C17\u9063\u3063\u3066\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You\u0027re just like Criselda.\nLike her, you\u0027re trying to be considerate\nof my financial indifference."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5197\u8AC7\u3060\u3002\u305D\u308C\u3068\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3053\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3044\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was joking. And stop following me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3048\u3002\u79C1\u306F\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u3044\u305F\u3044\u3002\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u8208\u5473\u304C\u3042\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No. I want to stay with Sir Logy.\nYou interest me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u306A\u3093\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3002\u6050\u308D\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u306B\u3001\n\u3000\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u305F\u3060\u305F\u3060\u4FFA\u306B\n\u3000\u8208\u5473\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3060\u3051\u3089\u3057\u3044\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This is terrible. It seems he really is\njust genuinely interested in me...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u3053\u3067\u6E80\u8DB3\u3055\u305B\u3066\u304A\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3001\n\u3000\u4ECA\u5F8C\u305A\u3063\u3068\u4ED8\u304D\u307E\u3068\u308F\u308C\u308B\n\u3000\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u306A\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(If I don\u0027t satisfy his curiosity now,\nhe might follow me around forever...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3042\u2026\u2026\u5206\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\u597D\u304D\u306B\u3057\u308D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh*... Fine. Do what you want."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\u3067\u306F\u3001\u304A\u8A00\u8449\u306B\u7518\u3048\u3066\u3001\u9685\u304B\u3089\u9685\u307E\u3067\n\u898B\u3055\u305B\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3068\u3082",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you very much.\nThen, with your permission, I shall observe\nyour every move."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u2026\u2026\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u308B\u306E\u306F\u6B62\u3081\u3066\u3001\n\u3000\u30AB\u30D5\u30A7\u306B\u98DF\u4E8B\u3067\u3082\u884C\u304F\u304B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Maybe I\u0027ll skip going out\nand just head to a caf\u00E9 instead...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3042\u3042\u3001\u79C1\u306E\u3053\u3068\u306F\u6C17\u306B\u305B\u305A\n\u304A\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3092\u98DF\u3079\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Ah, please don\u0027t mind me.\nEat whatever you\u0027d like."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u3057\u3066\u3001\u5F53\u7136\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B\u76F8\u5E2D\u3067\u5EA7\u308B\u3068\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(And of course, he sits right across from me)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u3092\u6CE8\u6587\u3055\u308C\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are you going to order?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304C\u3063\u3064\u308A\u304A\u8089\u7CFB\u306E\u30E1\u30CB\u30E5\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A hearty meat dish"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u8089\u6599\u7406\u3092\u6CE8\u6587\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m thinking of ordering this meat dish."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3080\u3075\u3080\u3002\n\u8089\u6599\u7406\u304C\u597D\u304D\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, hmm.\nDo you have a preference for meat dishes?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u3001\u306A\u305C\u304B\u75B2\u52B4\u611F\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3057\u306A\u3002\n\u4F53\u529B\u3092\u3064\u3051\u3066\u304A\u3053\u3046\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I\u0027m feeling kind of tired.\nThought I should get some energy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305F\u3060\u3053\u308C\u3060\u3068\u6804\u990A\u306E\u504F\u308A\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\u666E\u6BB5\u306F\u91CE\u83DC\u3082\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But this alone would be nutritionally unbalanced.\nDo you usually eat vegetables too?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3002\u4E00\u5FDC\u305D\u306E\u3042\u305F\u308A\u306F\u6C17\u3092\u4ED8\u3051\u3066\u3044\u308B\n\u3064\u3082\u308A\u3060\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, I try to watch that sort of thing..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8907\u6570\u306E\u54C1\u304C\u51FA\u3066\u3044\u308B\u5834\u5408\u3001\u98DF\u3079\u308B\u9806\u756A\u3067\u3082\n\u6804\u990A\u306E\u5438\u53CE\u306E\u3055\u308C\u65B9\u304C\u7570\u306A\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\u79C1\u306E\u7814\u7A76\u306B\u3088\u308B\u3068\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The order in which you eat multiple dishes\ncan affect nutrient absorption.\nAccording to my research..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u4FFA\u3088\u308A\u4E0D\u5065\u5EB7\u305D\u3046\u306A\u5974\u306B\u3001\n\u3000\u3081\u3061\u3083\u304F\u3061\u3083\u5065\u5EB7\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u8A9E\u3089\u308C\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I just got a lecture about health from someone\nwho looks less healthy than me...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6D77\u306E\u9B5A\u7CFB\u306E\u30E1\u30CB\u30E5\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A seafood dish"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u9B5A\u6599\u7406\u3092\u6CE8\u6587\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m thinking of ordering this fish dish."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6D77\u306E\u9B5A\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3002\n\u3053\u308C\u306F\u6804\u990A\u8C4A\u5BCC\u3067\u3068\u3066\u3082\u3044\u3044\u98DF\u6750\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u666E\u6BB5\u304B\u3089\u98DF\u3079\u3089\u308C\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Seafood? That\u0027s a very nutritious choice.\nDo you eat it often?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4FFA\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u306B\u6D77\u306F\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u304B\u3089\u306A\u3002\n\u3064\u3044\u73CD\u3057\u304F\u3066\u983C\u3093\u3067\u3057\u307E\u3046\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There was no ocean in my world.\nI can\u0027t help ordering it since it\u0027s still novel to me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3068\u3002\u3082\u3057\u3084\u3053\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u3067\u521D\u3081\u3066\n\u9B5A\u3092\u76EE\u306B\u3057\u305F\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my! Perhaps this is your first time\nseeing fish?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9B5A\u81EA\u4F53\u306F\u898B\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3042\u308B\u3088\u3002\n\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3053\u3053\u307E\u3067\u7A2E\u985E\u306F\u8C4A\u5BCC\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u5473\u3082\u2026\u2026\u3053\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u306E\u9B5A\u306F\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3044\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ve seen fish before.\nBut there weren\u0027t this many varieties.\nAnd the taste... the fish here is delicious."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u5FC3\u4E2D\u304A\u5BDF\u3057\u3057\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I understand how you feel."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u91CE\u83DC\u4E2D\u5FC3\u306E\u30E1\u30CB\u30E5\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A vegetable-focused dish"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u91CE\u83DC\u306E\u6599\u7406\u3092\u6CE8\u6587\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m thinking of ordering this vegetable dish."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8089\u3067\u3082\u9B5A\u3067\u3082\u306A\u304F\u91CE\u83DC\u3092\u3068\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u3053\u308C\u306F\u610F\u5916\u3067\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Neither meat nor fish, but vegetables.\nThat\u0027s unexpected."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306B\u91CE\u83DC\u3092\u3068\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306B\u898B\u3048\u308B\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do I look like I don\u0027t eat enough vegetables?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3068\u9055\u3063\u3066\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306F\u6D3B\u52D5\u91CF\u304C\n\u591A\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\u306D\u3002\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3063\u305F\u65B9\u306F\n\u8089\u3092\u597D\u3080\u50BE\u5411\u306B\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Unlike me, you seem quite active.\nSuch people tend to prefer meat."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u666E\u6BB5\u304B\u3089\u91CE\u83DC\u3092\u7A4D\u6975\u7684\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\n\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\u3000\u305D\u308C\u3068\u3082\u3001\u4ECA\u65E5\u304C\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\n\u6C17\u5206\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you usually eat vegetables actively?\nOr is it just your mood today?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6C17\u5206\u3060\u3002\u8089\u3067\u3082\u9B5A\u3067\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3057\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just my mood. I would\u0027ve been fine with meat or fish too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u597D\u307F\u306E\u504F\u308A\u304C\u3042\u308B\u308F\u3051\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\n\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you don\u0027t have any particular bias\nin your food preferences."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ED6\u306B\u3082\u304A\u5C0B\u306D\u3057\u305F\u3044\u3053\u3068\u304C\n\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u3042\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\n\u7D9A\u3051\u3066\u8CEA\u554F\u3057\u3066\u3082\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I have many more questions\nI\u0027d like to ask.\nMay I continue?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3001\u3042\u3042\u3002\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3060\u3002\n\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u3068\u3053\u3068\u3093\u4ED8\u304D\u5408\u3063\u3066\u3084\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, sure. Go ahead.\nI\u0027ll humor you today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u9650\u308A\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u3067\u306F\u3001\u6B21\u306E\u8CEA\u554F\u3067\u3059\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How delightful!\nNow, for my next question..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u306E\u5F8C\u3082\u5F7C\u306E\u597D\u5947\u5FC3\u306E\u8D74\u304F\u307E\u307E\u306B\u3001\n\u3000\u8272\u3005\u306A\u8CEA\u554F\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(He continued to ask various questions\naccording to his curiosity.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u76F8\u624B\u306B\u3059\u308B\u306E\u306F\u75B2\u308C\u308B\u304C\u3001\n\u3000\u4FFA\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u77E5\u308B\u306B\u3064\u308C\u3066\u3001\n\u3000\u4FFA\u306B\u5408\u308F\u305B\u305F\u914D\u616E\u3082\u898B\u305B\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(It\u0027s tiring to deal with him, but\nas he learns more about me, he\u0027s starting\nto show consideration for my preferences.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305F\u3060\u305F\u3060\u597D\u5947\u5FC3\u304C\u65FA\u76DB\u306A\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3001\n\u3000\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3088\u308A\u60AA\u3044\u5974\u3067\u306F\n\u3000\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(He might not be such a bad person after all...\nJust someone with an overwhelming curiosity.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]